          "guid": "mtnxksvrtrvzdrxj",
          "message": {
            "text": "Wait for .settings-tabs, not .settings-dialog, so the settings still isn't captured mid-spinner.\n\nThe settings dialog now renders in two stages (doc 33 native overlay / GB-1132): a .settings-dialog shell containing a .settings-loading spinner while its async build() loads data, then it swaps in the real shell with .settings-tabs. The old .settings-dialog wait matched the spinner stage, so the regenerated demo-settings.png caught a centered loading spinner instead of the dialog. .settings-tabs only exists post-load, so it's the reliable readiness gate.",
            "markdown": "Wait for `.settings-tabs`, not `.settings-dialog`, so the settings still isn't captured mid-spinner.\n\nThe settings dialog now renders in two stages (doc 33 native overlay / GB-1132): a `.settings-dialog` shell containing a `.settings-loading` spinner while its async `build()` loads data, then it swaps in the real shell with `.settings-tabs`. The old `.settings-dialog` wait matched the spinner stage, so the regenerated `demo-settings.png` caught a centered loading spinner instead of the dialog. `.settings-tabs` only exists post-load, so it's the reliable readiness gate."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "scripts/demo/capture-stills.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 178,
                  "endLine": 178,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      await page.waitForSelector('.settings-tabs', { timeout: 5000 });"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
